os-zapret2 bundled HTTP/3 client - third-party software notices

The HTTP/3 client bundled with os-zapret2 is built from:

  lexiforest/curl-impersonate

The package is fetched from the FreeBSD "latest" repository at build time, so
the exact version varies per build. The version actually shipped is recorded
in:

  /usr/local/libexec/zapret2/curl-h3/VERSION

The curl-impersonate project is distributed under the MIT License.

The bundled executable also incorporates third-party components used by
curl-impersonate, including curl, BoringSSL, nghttp2, ngtcp2, nghttp3,
zlib, Brotli, and Zstandard.

Their respective license notices are distributed alongside the bundled
HTTP/3 client, under:

  /usr/local/libexec/zapret2/curl-h3/licenses/
